MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Entidade Condition substitue polling da run queue por notificao.
Scheduler bloqueia no eventfd ate ser notificado (0% CPU idle).

- pon_condition.h: struct ErtsCondition com wake_fd (eventfd),
  epoll_fd, ready_list lock-free via CAS, API (create/destroy/
  notify/wait/try_dequeue/is_satisfied/get_epoll_fd)
- pon_condition.c: implementao completa (215 linhas)
- erl_process.h: +ErtsCondition pon_condition no ErtsSchedulerData
- erl_process.c: erts_pon_schedule_notify expandido para usar Condition
- pon_stats.h: +condition_wakeups, condition_notifications, sched_idle_blocks
- Makefile.in: +pon_condition.o
- Benchmark: sched_idle_cpu.erl
- Relatrio: RPT-04-pon-scheduler.md
